{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "41c99ff6-f2b9-450b-b43b-4bab3c084801",
    "name": "EducaShow - Sprint 1 Backend",
    "description": "Colección ejecutable en local para las APIs implementadas del Sprint 1. Importa también el environment 'EducaShow - Local', selecciónalo y ejecuta Run en orden. El login obtiene y guarda el JWT; la colección crea IDs de prueba y los reutiliza. Usuario semilla local: admin@educore.edu.pe / Admin2026! (cámbialo solo si la clave de tu base fue rotada).\n\nCobertura: US-3.5 Catálogo curricular, US-1.7 Vacantes por sección, US-5.5 Logs, US-5.6 login/solicitud de recuperación y operaciones actuales de US-5.2. Incluye matrícula académica actual, que no implementa por sí sola la US-1.1 independiente. No existen rutas backend para US-4.3 ni US-5.9 CSV.\n\nEl environment configura gradoId=1, que corresponde a 1.º de secundaria en una base local nueva con V12 aplicada. La API actual lista secciones pero no expone consulta de grados. Si tu base tiene IDs distintos, cambia gradoId. El flujo crea una sección libre automáticamente y matricula dos estudiantes para probar el rechazo 422 de capacidad.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Autenticación (US-5.6)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login administrador (guarda JWT)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUser}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Login exitoso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "const body = pm.response.json();", "pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;", "pm.environment.set('token', body.token);"] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil autenticado",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"] } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Perfil accesible con JWT', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Solicitar recuperación (respuesta genérica)",
          "request": { "auth": { "type": "noauth" }, "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUser}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password"] } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Solicitud aceptada sin revelar si existe la cuenta', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Restablecer contraseña (manual; activar y pegar el token recibido por correo)",
          "request": { "auth": { "type": "noauth" }, "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{passwordNueva}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"] }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (!pm.environment.get('resetToken') || pm.environment.get('resetToken') === 'pega-aqui-el-token-recibido-por-correo') pm.execution.skipRequest();"] } }, { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Contraseña restablecida', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Catálogo curricular (US-3.5)",
      "item": [
        { "name": "Listar áreas y competencias (incluye inactivas)", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/areas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "areas"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Listado de catálogo', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');"] } }] },
        {
          "name": "Crear área con competencia anidada (guarda IDs)",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Matemática Postman {{$guid}}\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Área curricular creada desde Postman\",\n  \"competencias\": [\n    {\n      \"nombre\": \"Resuelve problemas {{$guid}}\",\n      \"descripcion\": \"Competencia inicial\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/areas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "areas"] } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Área creada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));", "const area = pm.response.json();", "pm.expect(area.id).to.be.a('number');", "pm.expect(area.competencias).to.have.lengthOf.at.least(1);", "pm.environment.set('areaId', String(area.id));", "pm.environment.set('competenciaId', String(area.competencias[0].id));"] } }]
        },
        { "name": "Consultar área por ID numérico", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/areas/{{areaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "areas", "{{areaId}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Área consultada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Editar área sin reemplazar sus competencias", "request": { "method": "PUT", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Área Postman actualizada\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Descripción modificada\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/areas/{{areaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "areas", "{{areaId}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Área actualizada y conserva competencias', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.expect(pm.response.json().competencias.length).to.be.at.least(1);"] } }] },
        {
          "name": "Agregar competencia al área",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Competencia adicional {{$guid}}\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Agregada desde Postman\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/areas/{{areaId}}/competencias", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "areas", "{{areaId}}", "competencias"] } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Competencia creada en el área', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));", "const comp = pm.response.json();", "pm.environment.set('competenciaAdicionalId', String(comp.id));"] } }]
        },
        { "name": "Editar competencia por ID", "request": { "method": "PUT", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Competencia Postman editada\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Texto actualizado\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/competencias/{{competenciaId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "competencias", "{{competenciaId}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Competencia actualizada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Desactivar competencia", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"activo\": false\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/competencias/{{competenciaAdicionalId}}/estado", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "competencias", "{{competenciaAdicionalId}}", "estado"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Competencia desactivada sin borrarla', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.expect(pm.response.json().activo).to.eql(false);"] } }] },
        { "name": "Reactivar competencia", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"activo\": true\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/competencias/{{competenciaAdicionalId}}/estado", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "competencias", "{{competenciaAdicionalId}}", "estado"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Competencia reactivada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Desactivar área (baja lógica)", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"activo\": false\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/areas/{{areaId}}/estado", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "areas", "{{areaId}}", "estado"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Área desactivada y conservada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.expect(pm.response.json().activo).to.eql(false);"] } }] },
        { "name": "Reactivar área", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"activo\": true\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/areas/{{areaId}}/estado", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "areas", "{{areaId}}", "estado"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Área reactivada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"] } }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Vacantes por sección (US-1.7)",
      "item": [
        { "name": "Listar secciones y resumen de vacantes", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secciones", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "secciones"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Listado de secciones', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "const sections = pm.response.json();", "pm.expect(sections).to.be.an('array');", "pm.environment.set('usedSectionsGrade1', JSON.stringify(sections.filter(s => s.gradoNumero === 1).map(s => s.nombre)));", "const found = sections.find(s => s.nombre === pm.environment.get('seccionNombre'));", "if (found) pm.environment.set('seccionId', String(found.id));"] } }] },
        {
          "name": "Crear sección (usa un nombre libre)",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"gradoNumero\": 1,\n  \"nombre\": \"{{seccionNombre}}\",\n  \"vacantesTotales\": {{capacidad}}\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secciones", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "secciones"] } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const used = JSON.parse(pm.environment.get('usedSectionsGrade1') || '[]');", "const names = [];", "for (let c = 65; c <= 90; c++) names.push(String.fromCharCode(c));", "for (let a = 65; a <= 90; a++) for (let b = 65; b <= 90; b++) names.push(String.fromCharCode(a, b));", "const offset = Date.now() % names.length;", "const candidate = names.slice(offset).concat(names.slice(0, offset)).find(name => !used.includes(name));", "if (!candidate) throw new Error('No hay códigos libres para grado 1');", "pm.environment.set('seccionNombre', candidate);"] } }, { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Sección creada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));", "pm.environment.set('seccionId', String(pm.response.json().id));"] } }]
        },
        { "name": "Actualizar capacidad", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"vacantesTotales\": {{capacidadNueva}}\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secciones/{{seccionId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "secciones", "{{seccionId}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Capacidad actualizada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.expect(pm.response.json().vacantesTotales).to.eql(Number(pm.environment.get('capacidadNueva')));"] } }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Matrícula académica existente (base operativa; US-1.2 parcial)",
      "description": "La API actual modela periodos por grado y sección; no representa todavía una ventana independiente de matrícula US-1.1.",
      "item": [
        { "name": "Crear periodo académico para la sección recién creada", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"gradoId\": {{gradoId}},\n  \"seccionId\": {{seccionId}},\n  \"fechaInicio\": \"2026-03-01\",\n  \"fechaFin\": \"2026-12-20\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/periodos", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "periodos"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Periodo académico creado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));", "pm.environment.set('periodoId', String(pm.response.json().id));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Consultar vacantes del periodo", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/periodos/{{periodoId}}/vacantes", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "periodos", "{{periodoId}}", "vacantes"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Resumen de vacantes', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('vacantesDisponibles');"] } }] },
        { "name": "Crear estudiante de prueba 1 (guarda estudianteId)", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"postman.alumno.{{studentSuffix}}@example.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Temporal123!\",\n  \"dni\": \"9{{studentSuffix}}\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana Postman\",\n  \"apellidoPaterno\": \"Prueba\",\n  \"apellidoMaterno\": \"Local\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2012-05-10\",\n  \"telefono\": \"999111222\",\n  \"genero\": \"FEMENINO\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estudiantes", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "estudiantes"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('studentSuffix', String(Date.now()).slice(-11) + String(Math.floor(Math.random() * 10))); "] } }, { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Estudiante creado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));", "pm.environment.set('estudianteId', String(pm.response.json().estudianteId));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Crear estudiante de prueba 2 (guarda estudiante2Id)", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"postman.alumno.{{studentSuffix}}@example.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Temporal123!\",\n  \"dni\": \"9{{studentSuffix}}\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Luis Postman\",\n  \"apellidoPaterno\": \"Prueba\",\n  \"apellidoMaterno\": \"Local\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2012-06-11\",\n  \"telefono\": \"999111223\",\n  \"genero\": \"MASCULINO\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estudiantes", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "estudiantes"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('studentSuffix', String(Date.now()).slice(-11) + String(Math.floor(Math.random() * 10))); "] } }, { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Segundo estudiante creado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));", "pm.environment.set('estudiante2Id', String(pm.response.json().estudianteId));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Matricular estudiante 1 en el periodo", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"estudianteId\": {{estudianteId}}\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/periodos/{{periodoId}}/matriculas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "periodos", "{{periodoId}}", "matriculas"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Primera matrícula creada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Matricular estudiante 2 en el periodo", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"estudianteId\": {{estudiante2Id}}\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/periodos/{{periodoId}}/matriculas", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "periodos", "{{periodoId}}", "matriculas"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Segunda matrícula creada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Capacidad menor que matriculados (espera 422)", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"vacantesTotales\": 1\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/secciones/{{seccionId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "secciones", "{{seccionId}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Rechaza la capacidad por debajo de dos matrículas activas', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Eliminar matrícula de prueba 1", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/periodos/{{periodoId}}/matriculas/{{estudianteId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "periodos", "{{periodoId}}", "matriculas", "{{estudianteId}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Primera matrícula eliminada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Eliminar matrícula de prueba 2", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/periodos/{{periodoId}}/matriculas/{{estudiante2Id}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "periodos", "{{periodoId}}", "matriculas", "{{estudiante2Id}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Segunda matrícula eliminada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"] } }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Cuentas y roles (operaciones actuales de US-5.2)",
      "description": "La API permite crear y listar cuentas, y el catálogo/cuentas/logs/secciones están protegidos para ADMINISTRADOR. La autorización detallada para todos los módulos sigue pendiente.",
      "item": [
        { "name": "Crear cuenta docente de prueba", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"dni\": \"8{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Docente Postman\",\n  \"apellidoPaterno\": \"Prueba\",\n  \"apellidoMaterno\": \"Local\",\n  \"username\": \"postman.docente.{{$timestamp}}@example.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Temporal123!\",\n  \"rol\": \"DOCENTE\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } }, "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cuentas-usuario", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cuentas-usuario"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Cuenta creada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Listar cuentas (solo administrador)", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cuentas-usuario", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cuentas-usuario"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Listado de cuentas', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');"] } }] },
        { "name": "Comprobar 401 sin token", "request": { "auth": { "type": "noauth" }, "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cuentas-usuario", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cuentas-usuario"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Ruta protegida rechaza petición anónima', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"] } }] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Registro de errores (US-5.5)",
      "item": [
        { "name": "Generar un 404 de ruta para crear un log", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/__postman-no-existe-{{$timestamp}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "__postman-no-existe-{{$timestamp}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Ruta inexistente responde 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Listar logs con filtros y paginación", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/errores?page=0&size=20&sort=fechaHora,desc", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "logs", "errores"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "0" }, { "key": "size", "value": "20" }, { "key": "sort", "value": "fechaHora,desc" }, { "key": "nivel", "value": "ERROR", "disabled": true }, { "key": "modulo", "value": "common", "disabled": true }, { "key": "desde", "value": "2026-01-01", "disabled": true }, { "key": "hasta", "value": "2026-12-31", "disabled": true }] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Consulta paginada disponible', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "const body = pm.response.json();", "const entries = body.content || body._embedded?.registroErrorResponseDTOList || [];", "if (entries.length) pm.environment.set('errorId', String(entries[0].id));"] } }] },
        { "name": "Detalle de log (stackTrace solo para errores 500)", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/errores/{{errorId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "logs", "errores", "{{errorId}}"] } }, "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Detalle de log disponible', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));", "const detail = pm.response.json();", "pm.expect(detail.id).to.eql(Number(pm.environment.get('errorId')));", "if (detail.codigoEstado >= 500) pm.expect(detail.stackTrace).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;"] } }] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
